\begin{abstract}
This monograph presents the complete specification, mathematical
foundation, and validation framework for the ASSDI-WPE Core, a
SupraKernel Sovereign Architecture implementing continuous-yield,
multi-messenger, relativistic multi-physics computation. The system
integrates astrophysical ingest, relativistic nuclear reaction modeling,
thermodynamic substrate encryption (TSECE), and autonomous execution
directives into a unified architecture designed for extreme-load,
physics-bound operation.
\end{abstract}

